        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "For Sale – 2 Bedroom Terraced Home\r\nKnightstreet, Ballingarry, Co. Limerick\r\n\r\nJohn Giltinane & Associates are delighted to bring this recently renovated two-bedroom terraced home to the market, ideally situated in the heart of Ballingarry, Co. Limerick.\r\n\r\nThis well-presented property offers comfortable and modern accommodation, making it an excellent opportunity for a first-time buyer or those looking to downsize.\r\n\r\nThe property has been recently renovated and is presented in good condition throughout, with bright and practical living accommodation. Its central location is a particular feature, with a range of local amenities within easy walking distance, including shops, services and other everyday conveniences.\r\n\r\nAccommodation:\r\n\r\nGround Floor\r\nFitted Kitchen:\r\nA modern fitted kitchen with ample storage and worktop space, together with convenient access to the rear of the property.\r\n8.55m x 10.39m – 88.87 sq. ft. approx.\r\n\r\nSitting / Dining Room:\r\nA spacious and comfortable open living area providing an ideal setting for both everyday living and entertaining.\r\n17.57m x 8.33m – 146.29 sq. ft. approx.\r\n\r\nFirst Floor\r\nMain Bathroom:\r\nFitted with a shower, wash hand basin and WC.\r\n3.96m x 4.67m – 18.46 sq. ft. approx.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1:\r\nA well-proportioned double bedroom with good natural light.\r\n11.15m x 8.27m – 92.19 sq. ft. approx.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2:\r\nA comfortable second bedroom, suitable as a bedroom, home office or guest room.\r\n8.55m x 6.95m – 59.44 sq. ft. approx.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n*Recently renovated throughout\r\n*Two-bedroom terraced home\r\n*Modern fitted kitchen\r\n*Bright and comfortable living accommodation\r\n*Convenient central location\r\n*Walking distance to local amenities\r\n*Ideal first-time buyer or downsizing opportunity\r\n*Suitable investment property\r\n\r\nLocation:\r\nKnightstreet is conveniently located in Ballingarry village, with a selection of local amenities and services close by. The property provides an excellent opportunity for those seeking a home in a well-established village setting while remaining within easy reach of the surrounding towns and wider road network.\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended to appreciate the quality, presentation and convenient location of this recently renovated home."
      },
